---
globs: **/*.json,**/*.jsonc
alwaysApply: false
---
# JSON / JSONC

- Minimal edits: change only the keys required for the request.
- Preserve existing formatting conventions (indentation, trailing commas if allowed, etc.).
- Do not reorder large sections unless explicitly requested.
- If JSONC (comments allowed), preserve comments and do not convert to strict JSON.
- When editing config schemas, prefer additive changes and avoid breaking renames.
